        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Morgan Llywelyn, Robert Jordan, Brian Boru\n- Works: Lion of Ireland, The Wheel of Time\n- Concepts: One Power\n- Genres: historical fantasy, historical fiction, historical non-fiction, epic fantasy\n\nFacts:\n- Morgan Llywelyn, born on December 3, 1937, is an American-Irish writer of historical fantasy, historical fiction, and historical non-fiction.\n- Robert Jordan was the pen name of James Oliver Rigney Jr., who lived from October 17, 1948 to September 16, 2007 and was an American author of epic fantasy.\n- Lion of Ireland is a novel by Morgan Llywelyn about the life of the Irish hero and High King Brian Boru.\n- In Robert Jordan’s The Wheel of Time series, the One Power is a supernatural force that some characters can harness to perform magic.",
